        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah melihat dan menggunakan banyak jenis nilai yang berbeda. Dalam istilah pemrograman, berbagai jenis nilai ini disebut <strong>tipe</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>String adalah karakter yang berada di antara tanda kutip <code>\" \"</code>, seperti nilai <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PlayerOne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Number</strong> adalah tipe lain yang sudah pernah kita gunakan. Tipe ini merepresentasikan nilai numerik seperti <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tipe <strong>boolean</strong> hanya berisi dua nilai: nilai khusus <code>true</code> dan <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isGameOver);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat menyimpan <code>false</code> di <code>isPaused</code>, kita mengatakan bahwa kita <strong>menetapkan</strong> nilai ke sebuah variabel.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>isPaused</code>, diikuti oleh <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk nilai seperti boolean, string, dan angka?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tipe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Tipe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita mengenali nilai bertipe <strong>string</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan tanda kutip <code>\" \"</code> yang mengapitnya </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena selalu berupa kata atau huruf</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan tanda kutip <code>\" \"</code> yang mengapitnya .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nilai mana yang bertipe <strong>number</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"100\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa saja nilai <strong>boolean</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code> dan <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"True\"</code> dan <code>\"False\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> dan <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dimaksud dengan assignment variabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menyimpan nilai di dalam variabel</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Memberi nama pada variabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menyimpan nilai di dalam variabel.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tetapkan <strong>string</strong> ke variabel <code>levelName</code>, <strong>number</strong> ke <code>score</code>, dan <strong>boolean</strong> ke <code>hasKey</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName, score, hasKey);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Forest\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2800</code>, dan terakhir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan nilai <strong>string</strong> ke dalam variabel <code>enemyType</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan nilai <strong>number</strong> ke dalam variabel.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" livesLeft = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(livesLeft);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>livesLeft</code>, diikuti oleh <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berikan <code>isPaused</code> nilai <strong>boolean</strong><code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berikan nilai <code>57</code> ke variabel <code>const</code><code>enemyCount</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fifty-seven&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount = \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyCount);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>enemyCount</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>57</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17176,
        "title": "Bekerja dengan tipe",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> adalah tanda untuk menggabungkan atau menjumlahkan. Dalam game, kita sering menjumlahkan angka (seperti damage) dan juga menggabungkan string (seperti teks UI).</p><p>Saat menggabungkan dua nilai, kita bisa mendapatkan hasil yang berbeda bergantung pada tipenya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat menggabungkan angka dengan string, angka tersebut akan otomatis diubah menjadi string.</p><p>Gabungkan nilainya dan lihat string yang dihasilkan untuk pesan UI game.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gabungkan string dan angka untuk menampilkan skor pemain.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;99&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>99</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambahkan angka ke string juga berfungsi saat kita menggunakan variabel seperti <code>score</code> yang menyimpan angka, bukan nilai numerik.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa menggabungkan string dan boolean.</p><p>Gabungkan string dan boolean untuk menampilkan penanda status game. Apakah pemain masih hidup?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sekali lagi, menambahkan boolean ke string juga berfungsi saat kita menggunakan variabel seperti <code>isPaused</code> yang menyimpan boolean.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + isPaused;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tanda apa yang kita gunakan untuk menambahkan atau menggabungkan dua nilai?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa tipe hasil dari menggabungkan string dengan angka?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">angka</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 damage</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 \"damage\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelLevel</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa hasil dari menggabungkan string dan boolean?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Boolean</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebuah string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss defeated: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai angka untuk mendapatkan skor akhir pemain.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai string ke nilai numerik dan lihat hasil stringnya untuk HUD game.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\" coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai angka ke string.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
